# PostHog project API key (phc_...). PUBLIC: a write-only ingestion token, not
# a secret, safe to ship in the browser bundle. Optional: absent means the
# PostHog SDK never loads client-side and server error reporting
# (instrumentation.ts) no-ops, both cleanly.
#
# This site reports into the SAME PostHog project as every other bet, tagged
# site=merigaud (see lib/analytics.ts) so one shared project stays filterable
# per site.
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
